### Question 2.12 · Advanced · Multiple response · select TWO

Which TWO Claude outputs can reasonably be used after a careful read, without checking
against an outside source? (Select TWO.)

**A.** Taglines brainstormed for an internal wellness campaign

**B.** A summary of this year's new tax-filing deadlines

